WEBVTT

00:16:29.455 --> 00:16:31.504
in joining the educational system,

00:16:31.528 --> 00:16:35.254
and actually channel that
into building true political power,

00:16:35.278 --> 00:16:37.537
we will reshape this century,

00:16:37.561 --> 00:16:39.693
because one of us can be ignored,

00:16:39.717 --> 00:16:41.503
two of us can be dismissed,

00:16:41.527 --> 00:16:43.637
but together, we're a movement,

00:16:43.661 --> 00:16:44.905
and we're unstoppable.

00:16:45.355 --> 00:16:46.563
Thank you.

00:16:46.587 --> 00:16:48.373
(Applause and cheers)

00:16:48.397 --> 00:16:49.555
Thank you.

00:16:49.579 --> 00:16:50.880
(Applause)